    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted present to the market this excellently located home in the popular Woodhaven development. Castletroy is one of Limericks most desirable residential areas as it is within walking distance of an array of super amenities including the University of Limerick, Castletroy College, local national schools, Castletroy Shopping Centre, Castletroy Golf Club and many more. No. 71 Dromroe Avenue is a well-presented mid-terraced house situated in a desirable residential setting and benefits from a private garden, providing a pleasant outdoor space for residents to enjoy. The property also benefits from solar panels and an electric car charging point, offering excellent modern energy-efficient features and added convenience for the future homeowner. The accommodation consists of 3 bedrooms one of which is ensuite, living room, kitchen-diner, bathroom and wc. Viewing is highly recommended. Approx. size 96 sq/m (1,044 sq/ft). Contact Julia Kearney."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall - With tiled floor, carpeted stairs and landing, guest wc off.\r\nLiving room - 5.30 x 3.38. Wood floor, open fire, bay window, double doors into kitchen-diner.\r\nKitchen-Diner - 4.10 x 5.33. Fitted kitchen with electric oven hob & extractor, washing machine, dishwasher, patio doors to rear garden.\r\nUpstairs:\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.00 x 3.91. Double bedroom with built in wardrobe, laminate floor, ensuite.\r\nEnsuite - 1.92 x 1.92. Fully tiled, wc whb, enclosed shower.\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.00 x 3.48. Double bedroom with built in wardrobe, laminate floor.\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.34 x 2.22. Large single room with laminate floor and built in wardrobe.\r\nBathroom - 2.20 x 1.71. Fully tiled, wc whb, bath with electric shower."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Super location walking distance to all amenities\r\nM7/M20/M18 motorway network is easily accessible \r\nIn excellent condition throughout\r\nThe property also benefits from solar panels and an electric car charging point\r\nFront driveway with parking \r\nBeautiful garden\r\nBuilt in wardrobes to all bedrooms\r\nGas fired central heating, double glazed pvc windows\r\nAppliances included in sale"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Proceed to Castletroy on the R445 Dublin Road. At the Kilmurray Lodge roundabout take the 3rd exit. Continue straight through the next small roundabout at Castletroy Shopping Centre and on past Odeon Cinema. Take the next left into Woodhaven. Take the second left and the second left again. The house is located in the corner with Rooney for sale board."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "These Particulars and Terms are issued by Rooney Auctioneers (Limerick) Limited on the agreed understanding that all negotiations in respect of the property mentioned, are and will be conducted through them.  Whilst every care has been taken in preparing these Particulars and Terms of the said property, Rooney Auctioneers (Limerick) Limited do not warrant these Particulars and Terms or any representations made by them about the property and all intending purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness and/or accuracy of the information given.  \r\nRooney Auctioneers (Limerick) Limited shall further not be liable for any loss or expenses, which may be incurred in visiting the property, should it prove unsuitable or to have been let, sold or withdrawn."
      }
